  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administration Agreement - EU Support for the Palestinian Economy and Resilience II (ESPERE II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;to increase economic opportunities for IT service firms in the West Bank and Gaza, through: human capital improvement stipends, advisory services on managerial capabilities; IT and gender needs assessment and engagement; seeds grants to stimulate private investments in the IT service ecosystem; grants for shared R&amp;D hubs/labs; grants for IT business infrastructures; improving market access and increasing demand and investments;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
